{"about_the_game":"Puzzle One is an extremely difficult casual permutation puzzle sandbox. Turn the handles to rearrange the marbles into their original state. This game is a 2D analogue of the popular 3D twisty puzzle genre, and will appeal to people interested in twisty puzzles and speed solving.<br><br>This game is very, very challenging.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20 built in puzzles.<br></li><li>Leaderboards to track fastest solves and fewest moves (average of 5 solves).<br></li><li>An editor with Steam Workshop support.<br></li><li>Extensive color options to avoid colorblindness issues.</li></ul><br>Puzzle One is a sandbox. It runs like an application, and has no form of progression. All puzzles are immediately available. There is no specific goal. Figure out a difficult puzzle, or try to beat your best time on one you've mastered.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/585920?t=1500051065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1500051065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1500051065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1500051065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Puzzle One is an extremely difficult casual permutation puzzle sandbox. Turn the handles to rearrange the marbles into their original state. This game is a 2D analogue of the popular 3D twisty puzzle genre, and will appeal to people interested in twisty puzzles and speed solving.<br><br>This game is very, very challenging.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">